y"],["ARC or PLC in Daniels County","/arc-plc/montana/daniels-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Daniels County shows January to February under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the grids, May to June came in at 54% of normal in 2025, and April to May in 2026 sits at 38% of normal so far. Grid 34296 had its driest year in 2017 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
